# 中文

本仓库公开只是为了方便浏览和学习，没有采用任何开源许可证，保留所有权利。

- 可以：在 GitHub 上浏览、阅读本仓库，以及按 GitHub 服务条款在 GitHub 内查看和 fork。
- 未经设计者书面许可，不可以：复制、修改、再发布、用于其他作品或商业用途，包括代码、图像、视频、SVG 和文字。
- 想复用其中内容，请先开 Issue 联系。

## 不属于设计者的内容

- D&D 相关设定：《龙与地下城》、深水城（Waterdeep）、黑杖（Blackstaff）等名称和设定归 Wizards of the Coast 所有。本仓库是非官方的粉丝内容，与 WotC 无关，也未获其认可。
- 角色设计：作品中的角色如果是其他玩家或画师创作的原创角色，角色设计归原作者所有。生图时用到的参考图不在本仓库中。
- 字体：网页里用到的字体都不属于设计者，仍按各自的 SIL Open Font License 1.1 授权（https://openfontlicense.org/），不受上面「保留所有权利」的限制：
  - Noto Serif SC（Google）：以子集形式嵌入 `html/bard-lute/` 和 `html/scribe-scroll/`。
  - Fondamento（Astigmatic）：以子集形式嵌入 `html/scribe-scroll/`，用于卷轴上的英文咒文。
  - Uncial Antiqua（Astigmatic）：`html/bard-lute/` 的标题与题记、`html/scribe-scroll/` 的湿壁画题记，是由它转成的文字轮廓。
  - ZCOOL XiaoWei（站酷）：`html/bard-lute/` 的中文标题，是由它转成的文字轮廓。

## 关于 AI 生成内容

代码由 Claude 编写，部分图像由 AI 生图工具生成（见 AI_NOTICE.md）。在一些法域，完全由 AI 生成、没有足够人类创作的内容可能不受版权保护。本声明只就设计者实际享有的权利保留权利，不对任何部分是否受版权保护作出判断。

# English

This repository is public so people can browse and learn from it. It is not
released under an open source license; all rights are reserved.

- You may view and read this repository on GitHub, and view and fork it within
  GitHub as permitted by the GitHub Terms of Service.
- Without written permission from the designer, you may not copy, modify,
  redistribute, reuse in other works, or use commercially any of its contents,
  including code, images, video, SVG and text.
- To ask about reuse, please open an issue.

## Content not owned by the designer

- D&D material: Dungeons & Dragons, Waterdeep, Blackstaff and related names and
  settings belong to Wizards of the Coast. This is unofficial fan content, not
  approved or endorsed by WotC.
- Character designs: original characters created by other players or artists
  remain theirs. Reference images used for image generation are not in this
  repository.
- Fonts: none of the fonts used in the web pages belong to the designer. Each
  remains under its own SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (https://openfontlicense.org/) and is not covered by the reservation of
  rights above:
  - Noto Serif SC (Google), embedded as a subset in html/bard-lute/ and
    html/scribe-scroll/.
  - Fondamento (Astigmatic), embedded as a subset in html/scribe-scroll/ for
    the incantations on the scroll.
  - Uncial Antiqua (Astigmatic), converted to letter outlines for the headings
    and titulus of html/bard-lute/ and the fresco titulus of
    html/scribe-scroll/.
  - ZCOOL XiaoWei (ZCOOL), converted to letter outlines for the Chinese
    headings of html/bard-lute/.

## About AI-generated content

The code was written by Claude and some images were made with AI image tools
(see AI_NOTICE.md). In some jurisdictions, material generated entirely by AI
without sufficient human authorship may not be protected by copyright. This
notice reserves only the rights the designer actually holds and makes no claim
about whether any particular part is copyrightable.
